Kind: ablation
Issue: #537
Takes out: all four of step 1 at once, the "before" arm of #537's comparisons -- the key's blocks hashed on every check, the MAC under cap_lock, no cache, the walk for the page. Not the four patches stacked: with 537-hmac-locked.patch the check hashes in cap_hmac_check(), which 537-hmac-full.patch does not reach
Run: --entry 14 1200 -smp 4
Measure: the whole ask and the kernel's part in the block server's per-page split, its line "in the kernel, over all N asks since boot" (#537 at 1.4 GHz: the whole ask 42 554 - 43 408 cycles on i386 against 15 953 - 16 039 with step 1, and 37 170 - 38 083 on x86-64 without an IOMMU against 12 571 - 12 766); against the same tree without the patch, under KVM; on x86-64 the asks reach 1024 pages only with UROS_BUNDLE_IPC_BENCH=ON and UROS_BUNDLE_IPC_BENCH_SUITES=disk

